  "title": "Bay Scallops with Garlic Parsley Butter Sauce",
  "description": "The fragrance of these beautiful, buttery bay scallops with their garlic parsley sauce is only surpassed by the taste!",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
